WEBVTT

01:36.300 --> 01:41.060
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.330 --> 01:43.950
[Episode 37]

01:45.039 --> 01:45.680
Chief.

01:45.900 --> 01:47.710
Liu Suifeng did exactly as you predicted.

01:47.710 --> 01:49.710
He sent Song Mingzhu to the pharmacy
for medicine.

01:49.710 --> 01:51.170
Could it be harmful to you?

01:53.680 --> 01:54.340
It won't be.

01:55.400 --> 01:56.530
Then why is Chief...

01:57.509 --> 02:00.280
I won't agree to what he wants to do.

02:01.480 --> 02:03.480
But I can't talk him out of it either.

02:04.780 --> 02:05.910
You should continue

02:06.790 --> 02:08.470
to keep a close eye on Suifeng.

02:11.060 --> 02:12.060
I understand.

03:10.310 --> 03:10.910
Master.

03:11.870 --> 03:13.030
Please reconsider.

03:18.560 --> 03:20.960
The Tang Sect living medicine vessel said,

03:21.000 --> 03:22.560
those who became living medicine vessel

03:22.560 --> 03:24.160
are neither human nor ghost.

03:24.250 --> 03:25.579
A fate worse than death.

03:40.490 --> 03:41.730
Mingzhu is afraid.

03:44.360 --> 03:46.760
I'm afraid that I might
never see you again.

04:03.150 --> 04:03.870
Get out.

04:06.680 --> 04:07.880
I don't want you to see

04:08.240 --> 04:10.640
what I look like
after taking the medicine.

06:03.510 --> 06:05.870
Turns out he endures pain
beyond what normal people could bear.

06:05.870 --> 06:07.040
all for the Chief.

06:18.830 --> 06:20.160
Master is turning himself

06:20.160 --> 06:22.070
into a living medicine vessel for Chief.

06:22.070 --> 06:24.200
He wants to trade his life for another.

06:25.270 --> 06:26.040
Master.

06:27.530 --> 06:29.530
Mingzhu will never leave your side.

06:29.930 --> 06:32.040
I've called you all here today

06:32.790 --> 06:34.450
because we've received news.

06:34.870 --> 06:37.080
General Wu has started his journey
back to the capital.

06:37.080 --> 06:38.870
The Falconry Whistle Organization
has colluded with the Northern Wasteland

06:38.870 --> 06:40.470
and bypassed Immortal Pass.

06:40.720 --> 06:43.380
They're using the waterways
to smuggle elite Northern Wastelanders

06:43.380 --> 06:44.630
into Daxi

06:44.680 --> 06:46.210
with sinister intentions.

06:46.550 --> 06:49.550
General Wu's return journey
is extremely dangerous.

06:49.560 --> 06:52.480
I ask you all
to ensure General Wu's safety.

06:52.920 --> 06:54.430
Take down the Falconry Whistle's base

06:54.430 --> 06:55.890
and restore peace to Daxi.

06:56.360 --> 06:57.350
Take down the Falconry Whistle's base

06:57.350 --> 06:58.360
and destroy the Waterways' schemes.

06:58.360 --> 06:59.870
We will do our best.

07:00.120 --> 07:00.820
That's right.

07:00.820 --> 07:02.560
The survival of the nation
is every citizen’s responsibility.

07:02.560 --> 07:04.190
We shall contribute our efforts.

07:04.190 --> 07:06.120
We shall contribute our efforts.

07:09.800 --> 07:10.400
Thank you.

07:21.450 --> 07:22.080
Come.

07:22.790 --> 07:23.720
Everyone, look.

07:24.960 --> 07:25.480
Here.

07:25.510 --> 07:26.570
You'll go this way.

07:27.050 --> 07:28.340
You'll come with me this way.

07:28.340 --> 07:29.470
Good. Is that clear?

07:29.480 --> 07:29.970
Good.

07:38.870 --> 07:39.560
Brothers.

07:40.120 --> 07:41.480
This is Wu Jie.

07:42.240 --> 07:43.560
Take a good look at him.

07:45.470 --> 07:48.390
We'll set up ambushes along the route

07:48.700 --> 07:50.490
and catch him completely off guard.

07:50.490 --> 07:51.400
Good.

07:57.440 --> 07:58.200
Nobody move!

08:01.680 --> 08:02.950
You pack of scoundrels!

08:02.950 --> 08:04.720
How dare you plot against General Wu!

08:04.720 --> 08:07.120
Today, we brothers
will carry out heaven's justice.

08:07.120 --> 08:07.980
Take them down!

08:08.310 --> 08:10.240
Over ten martial world criminals
have been captured.

08:10.240 --> 08:12.480
They all claim to be hired
by the Long River waterways.

08:12.480 --> 08:13.720
Anyone who provides information

08:13.720 --> 08:15.040
will be generously rewarded.

08:15.040 --> 08:16.270
Whoever captures Wu Jie

08:16.270 --> 08:17.510
will be rewarded ten thousand taels.

08:17.510 --> 08:18.850
Around Zhoushan Town in Western Capital,

08:18.850 --> 08:20.160
General Wu's whereabouts
have been discovered.

08:20.160 --> 08:21.350
Likely due to the previous attack,

08:21.350 --> 08:23.550
he has changed his route to the capital.

08:23.720 --> 08:25.160
Near a Guan Temple in the west of town,

08:25.160 --> 08:27.960
unknown martial world figures
have been spotted.

08:30.040 --> 08:32.039
Guan Temple in the Western Capital.

09:35.960 --> 09:37.730
[Wu Jie, Renowned Border General of Daxi]

09:42.870 --> 09:44.960
Lord Guan is a man of great honour

09:45.130 --> 09:47.200
who protected Han with absolute loyalty.

09:47.200 --> 09:49.510
He deserves our admiration.

09:50.600 --> 09:51.510
Such a pity

09:51.720 --> 09:52.920
that years of warfare

09:53.150 --> 09:54.720
have left his temple in disrepair.

09:54.720 --> 09:56.980
After we strike at the heart of the enemy,

09:57.400 --> 09:59.750
we will surely return
to rebuild the temple.

09:59.750 --> 10:01.360
Now that traitors are ruling the court,

10:01.360 --> 10:03.630
returning would only mean death for us.

10:04.050 --> 10:06.050
Death itself doesn't matter,

10:06.550 --> 10:08.870
but how can a true man
endure such humiliation?

10:08.870 --> 10:10.840
We should return to Immortal Pass

10:11.320 --> 10:12.720
and join our brothers

10:13.120 --> 10:15.070
to fight all the way
to the Northern Wasteland capital

10:15.070 --> 10:16.510
and see if they dare defy us again.

10:16.510 --> 10:17.360
Jiang Yue!

10:18.510 --> 10:19.570
Show some respect.

10:20.180 --> 10:21.510
I acknowledge my fault.

10:30.390 --> 10:31.850
I can't blame you for this.

10:32.320 --> 10:35.030
The people are in the depths of misery.

10:35.790 --> 10:38.830
But the Emperor's authority is supreme

10:39.360 --> 10:40.960
and his grace is like heaven.

10:41.230 --> 10:43.290
We must not speak rashly against him.

10:43.510 --> 10:45.150
If everyone acted this way,

10:45.790 --> 10:47.120
there would be no order,

10:47.510 --> 10:49.150
destroying a family's honour.

10:49.150 --> 10:50.810
How disgraceful will that be?

10:51.000 --> 10:52.720
If a nation loses its laws and principles,

10:52.720 --> 10:55.080
disaster and ruin will follow swiftly.

10:55.750 --> 10:58.270
A general in the field
may sometimes disregard orders,

10:58.270 --> 10:59.480
but our country is facing many troubles

10:59.480 --> 11:01.390
at this critical time
of repelling invaders.

11:01.390 --> 11:03.270
If I were to act rebelliously,

11:03.630 --> 11:07.200
I fear I would play
into the traitors' hands,

11:07.440 --> 11:08.670
harm the state

11:09.510 --> 11:11.550
and become a sinner for the ages.

11:11.840 --> 11:12.600
Big Brother,

11:13.000 --> 11:14.660
the court is summoning you back

11:14.660 --> 11:16.010
only to kill you!

11:16.510 --> 11:17.970
This is their conspiracy.

11:18.120 --> 11:19.380
Even if we must return,

11:19.450 --> 11:20.810
there's no need to rush.

11:20.840 --> 11:21.600
Jiang Yue!

11:25.430 --> 11:26.690
You guys may leave now.

11:27.240 --> 11:28.000
Yes.

11:28.020 --> 11:28.770
Yes.

11:33.960 --> 11:34.840
Lord Guan,

11:35.910 --> 11:37.840
our nation faces great peril now,

11:38.440 --> 11:40.040
with Northern Wasteland invading

11:40.040 --> 11:41.240
and traitors within.

11:41.910 --> 11:44.320
With your loyal heart and courage,

11:44.870 --> 11:47.750
please watch over this situation

11:48.240 --> 11:49.910
and protect us.

11:50.720 --> 11:51.910
This journey I take

11:54.160 --> 11:56.470
will likely end in my death.

11:57.550 --> 11:59.870
The traitors want me dead to feel secure,

12:00.350 --> 12:02.780
the court wants me dead to feel at ease,

12:03.060 --> 12:05.720
and the Northern Wastelanders
wants me dead to be content.

12:05.720 --> 12:08.370
I, Wu Xie, count my life as nothing.

12:09.250 --> 12:12.410
But our land remains divided,

12:12.750 --> 12:14.300
and the Northern Wastelanders

12:14.300 --> 12:15.900
have invaded without cause,

12:16.600 --> 12:19.930
plundering, killing,
and seizing our people with cruelty.

12:20.750 --> 12:23.280
Thus I swore to lead troops
against the enemy.

12:24.870 --> 12:27.270
Now I have three wishes.

12:27.790 --> 12:30.510
First, I pray for the nation's peace

12:30.840 --> 12:32.500
and the world's tranquility.

12:32.910 --> 12:34.390
If my death

12:34.960 --> 12:37.000
can win the people's hearts,

12:37.550 --> 12:38.750
eliminate traitors,

12:38.960 --> 12:40.000
protect Daxi,

12:40.270 --> 12:41.800
and restore our territory,

12:42.190 --> 12:45.460
I will die with a smile.

12:46.810 --> 12:48.300
My second wish

12:48.720 --> 12:51.000
is that the court take only my life

12:52.080 --> 12:54.910
and spare my brothers in arms

12:55.070 --> 12:56.900
and the innocent civilians.

12:57.270 --> 12:58.800
The border defence is weak.

12:59.030 --> 13:00.830
We absolutely cannot withdraw.

13:01.080 --> 13:04.270
A withdrawal would waste all our efforts.

13:05.020 --> 13:07.080
Our brothers who shed blood and sweat

13:07.200 --> 13:08.910
would have died in vain.

13:10.080 --> 13:13.120
May Lord Guan bless us.

13:15.890 --> 13:16.620
Big Brother.

13:18.250 --> 13:20.380
The Emperor's messenger has arrived.

13:21.680 --> 13:23.010
Greetings, General Wu.

13:26.290 --> 13:28.120
[Wu Jie to return immediately]

13:34.080 --> 13:35.010
Spread the word.

13:35.120 --> 13:36.360
We leave immediately.

13:36.360 --> 13:37.080
Yes, sir.

13:44.910 --> 13:46.510
For my third wish,

13:46.960 --> 13:50.370
I'm willing to go through
hell and high water.

13:50.670 --> 13:51.480
Otherwise,

13:52.560 --> 13:54.240
when our country is no longer a country,

13:54.240 --> 13:55.790
how can we have homes?

13:56.360 --> 13:57.510
When the nest falls,

13:57.630 --> 13:58.890
no eggs remain intact.

13:59.310 --> 14:03.620
I hope our frontline soldiers
can defend Immortal Pass to the death.

14:10.380 --> 14:11.090
Hero,

14:11.750 --> 14:13.910
you truly care about me.

14:14.550 --> 14:16.640
I appreciate it deeply.

14:17.190 --> 14:20.000
I'm not acting on impulse

14:20.510 --> 14:22.510
or seeking fame for posterity.

14:23.030 --> 14:24.430
I'm simply willing to die

14:24.790 --> 14:26.670
to preserve my complete loyalty.

15:23.840 --> 15:26.600
[General Wu in peril at the Guan Temple
of Zhoushan, Western Capital]

15:36.970 --> 15:37.640
Brother.

15:46.160 --> 15:46.880
Yuan'er.

15:48.660 --> 15:49.190
Brother.

15:49.510 --> 15:51.200
The Soul-Piercing Nail was just removed.

15:51.200 --> 15:53.130
You should be resting properly now

15:53.720 --> 15:55.180
and follow instructions.

15:56.400 --> 15:57.000
Yuan'er.

15:58.080 --> 15:59.410
You've really grown up,

15:59.710 --> 16:00.640
not like before.

16:01.120 --> 16:03.460
You used to follow me around
calling "brother" all the time.

16:03.460 --> 16:04.100
Look,

16:04.510 --> 16:06.510
now you're the one taking care of me.

16:07.080 --> 16:09.240
Who told you to be so troublesome?

16:13.790 --> 16:14.320
Oh right,

16:14.660 --> 16:15.390
look at this.

16:16.150 --> 16:16.790
This is...

16:17.240 --> 16:18.240
This is for you.

16:19.200 --> 16:20.000
For me?

16:26.910 --> 16:27.840
It's beautiful.

16:28.080 --> 16:28.880
Do you like it?

16:29.150 --> 16:31.010
Of course I like it, it's from you.

16:31.390 --> 16:32.120
Is it pretty?

16:32.720 --> 16:33.720
It's gorgeous.

16:50.480 --> 16:52.270
This medicine is too bitter.

16:52.510 --> 16:55.440
How nice it would be
to have some fresh fish right now.

16:55.910 --> 16:57.240
I'll go make some fish for you right away.

16:57.240 --> 16:57.960
Wait for me.

17:13.640 --> 17:14.170
Brother.

17:23.440 --> 17:24.680
Who would have thought,

17:24.680 --> 17:26.030
all the notorious villains

17:26.030 --> 17:28.790
in the Daxi martial world have gathered.

17:30.880 --> 17:32.510
Zhu the Great King, of the waterways,

17:32.510 --> 17:35.160
has sent Wanli, Qianli, and Baili,

17:35.160 --> 17:36.620
three great masters here.

17:36.880 --> 17:37.790
Today,

17:38.110 --> 17:40.680
we will capture General Wu
in one fell swoop.

17:41.680 --> 17:42.920
How dare you!

17:43.510 --> 17:45.110
Such treacherous traitors,

17:45.160 --> 17:46.690
shameless and despicable!

17:47.350 --> 17:49.680
Let me clear the obstacles for General Wu!

18:04.640 --> 18:07.640
In the Western Capital,
there's revelry every night,

18:08.270 --> 18:11.400
while at the border,
soldiers die wrapped in horsehide.

18:13.480 --> 18:14.750
Poor Lord Guan,

18:14.750 --> 18:16.610
no one even worships him anymore.

18:46.030 --> 18:46.720
General,

18:47.320 --> 18:49.580
it looks like there was just a fight here.

18:57.490 --> 18:58.620
Mr. Yan.

19:03.830 --> 19:07.030
As they say, a true man
would rather die on the battlefield

19:08.240 --> 19:10.440
than perish at the hands of sycophants.

19:12.920 --> 19:14.580
Those people I killed outside

19:15.030 --> 19:17.230
aren't just scums of the martial world.

19:18.070 --> 19:20.110
Northern Wastelanders have infiltrated
among them.

19:20.110 --> 19:22.110
There's a bounty from the waterways

19:22.240 --> 19:24.110
to ambush and kill you.

19:25.160 --> 19:26.070
General Wu,

19:26.510 --> 19:27.640
please reconsider.

19:27.720 --> 19:28.920
If you're in danger,

19:29.920 --> 19:30.880
it would be the same as

19:30.880 --> 19:32.830
the death of countless civilians.

19:34.400 --> 19:38.200
Mr. Yan speaks words of wisdom.

19:42.200 --> 19:43.000
However...

19:44.960 --> 19:45.790
However what?

19:46.680 --> 19:50.200
Although I know this journey is dangerous,

19:50.750 --> 19:53.160
I must still proceed.

19:53.270 --> 19:55.400
Only by meeting the Emperor in person,

19:55.590 --> 19:58.750
can I possibly protect our nation.

19:59.240 --> 20:00.790
Daxi faces many hardships,

20:00.880 --> 20:02.720
snd now is the time to repel our enemies.

20:02.720 --> 20:04.270
If I were to back down,

20:04.640 --> 20:07.270
I fear it would play right into

20:07.270 --> 20:09.330
the schemes of
those treacherous court officials.

20:09.330 --> 20:10.920
If something happens to you,

20:10.920 --> 20:12.350
who else in the world

20:12.640 --> 20:14.310
could lead troops
against the Northern Wastelanders

20:14.310 --> 20:15.510
and protect our land?

20:15.790 --> 20:17.510
Mr. Yan, your good intentions

20:18.590 --> 20:20.830
are appreciated.

20:21.830 --> 20:22.510
General Wu.

20:25.880 --> 20:27.880
What if I use this Hero Command Token

20:27.960 --> 20:28.960
to stop you

20:29.510 --> 20:31.030
from returning to court?

20:42.490 --> 20:43.620
The fate of Daxi

20:46.070 --> 20:47.000
is in your hands.

20:50.200 --> 20:51.470
I have no choice.

21:11.030 --> 21:13.480
I'll let you die knowing the truth.

21:21.680 --> 21:22.510
It's you.

21:23.440 --> 21:24.570
Where is General Wu?

21:24.640 --> 21:26.480
General Wu has been captured
by my waterway agents,

21:26.480 --> 21:28.240
Wanli, Qianli, and Baili.

21:28.960 --> 21:30.560
Today at this Guan Di Temple,

21:30.590 --> 21:32.640
you are the one we've been waiting for.

21:32.640 --> 21:35.040
The number one madman
of the martial world,

21:35.350 --> 21:36.920
Crazy Yan.

21:40.030 --> 21:41.310
Your internal energy,

21:42.710 --> 21:44.470
I shall take it all.

21:58.450 --> 21:59.100
Brother!

22:00.210 --> 22:00.820
Brother!

22:02.080 --> 22:03.680
Xiao Kaiyan, you're insane!

22:04.030 --> 22:05.760
I won't let you hurt my brother!

22:05.920 --> 22:07.920
Now that you have your real brother,

22:08.390 --> 22:10.400
have you forgotten about me,
your second brother?

22:10.400 --> 22:12.030
You're the one who harmed our parents

22:12.030 --> 22:13.620
and destroyed the Xiao family.

22:13.620 --> 22:15.440
You don't deserve to be my brother.

22:15.440 --> 22:16.920
Then watch carefully.

22:18.070 --> 22:19.960
See who is truly superior

22:20.750 --> 22:24.210
and who is the true heir
of the Xiao family.

22:24.310 --> 22:25.000
No!

22:29.900 --> 22:31.300
You don't want him to die?

22:35.000 --> 22:35.830
Fine.

22:37.400 --> 22:39.590
As long as you obediently follow my orders

22:39.590 --> 22:40.790
and do as I say.

22:44.750 --> 22:45.750
I promise you.

22:48.310 --> 22:50.310
As long as you don't harm my brother,

22:50.920 --> 22:52.760
I'm willing to exchange my life for his.

22:52.760 --> 22:53.960
I won't let you die.

22:55.110 --> 22:56.030
Crazy Yan,

22:57.200 --> 22:59.060
didn't you want to see General Wu?

22:59.550 --> 23:00.350
Take him away.

23:03.640 --> 23:04.900
Alliance Leader Xiao.

23:05.160 --> 23:07.760
We were ambushed
on our way back to the capital.

23:08.270 --> 23:10.240
The General,
seeing the situation was suspicious,

23:10.240 --> 23:11.440
ordered us to split up

23:11.680 --> 23:13.640
and take the imperial tiger tally with us

23:13.640 --> 23:15.440
to pass it to you, Alliance Leader Xiao.

23:15.440 --> 23:18.700
I ask that Alliance Leader Xiao
safeguard this tiger tally

23:18.790 --> 23:20.120
and rescue the General.

23:32.880 --> 23:33.550
Qiu.

23:34.110 --> 23:36.300
Take Deputy Commander Jiang to rest.

23:36.650 --> 23:37.240
Yes.

23:38.550 --> 23:39.350
Thank you.

23:39.750 --> 23:41.610
Deputy Commander Jiang, please.

24:00.830 --> 24:03.030
I've carefully selected these for you.

24:03.350 --> 24:04.280
Do you like them?

24:14.320 --> 24:15.640
Don't frown.

24:16.310 --> 24:18.720
You're not beautiful when you frown.

24:21.640 --> 24:23.100
Look at my water fortress.

24:23.400 --> 24:26.460
It's a hundred times more magnificent
than Huanhua's.

24:27.070 --> 24:28.310
If you come with me,

24:28.830 --> 24:30.920
whatever Yiren and Qiushui can give you,

24:30.920 --> 24:32.450
I'll give you twice as much.

24:33.200 --> 24:34.310
Wealth and luxury,

24:35.070 --> 24:36.510
power and prestige,

24:37.070 --> 24:38.130
you'll have it all.

24:51.960 --> 24:53.290
I want to see my brother.

24:53.480 --> 24:54.960
As long as you behave,

24:55.680 --> 24:57.010
your brother won't die.

24:57.070 --> 24:59.200
I'll even let you see each other often.

25:07.000 --> 25:08.530
How about wearing this one?

25:22.640 --> 25:23.970
It suits you quite well.

25:25.680 --> 25:26.810
It looks beautiful.

25:45.920 --> 25:47.520
Mr. Yan, you're very clever.

25:48.070 --> 25:49.730
You didn't struggle too much.

25:50.680 --> 25:53.010
You should know that I've already blocked

25:53.680 --> 25:55.140
all your pressure points.

26:02.110 --> 26:04.370
The Three Crown Kings of the Outer Realm.

26:05.920 --> 26:10.070
You are Baili, Frozen Pavilions,

26:10.090 --> 26:12.090
[The Three Crown Kings of the Outer Realm;
Baili, Frozen Pavilions]

26:12.110 --> 26:14.430
[The Three Crown Kings of the Outer Realm;
Qianli, Lone Plum Blossoms]

26:12.680 --> 26:14.280
Qianli, Lone Plum Blossoms,

26:15.310 --> 26:17.910
and Wanli, Endless Plains.

26:17.660 --> 26:19.610
[The Three Crown Kings of the Outer Realm;
Wanli, Endless Plains.]

26:20.270 --> 26:21.680
As expected of Crazy Yan.

26:22.480 --> 26:24.270
We've been in seclusion for years,

26:24.270 --> 26:25.800
yet you still recognise us.

26:26.550 --> 26:28.030
I just never thought

26:28.160 --> 26:29.750
we would meet here.

26:31.030 --> 26:32.880
If I hadn't promised General Helian

26:32.880 --> 26:34.440
to prioritize the greater mission,

26:34.440 --> 26:38.070
I would really like to test my skills
against the best in the Central Plains.

26:38.070 --> 26:40.200
You're just talking to yourselves.

26:41.590 --> 26:44.650
You think I can't break through
these pressure points?

26:50.000 --> 26:52.480
Mr. Yan's martial arts are unparalleled.

26:53.000 --> 26:54.160
Of course you can.

26:55.110 --> 26:56.070
However,

26:56.810 --> 26:58.610
I won't give you that much time.

27:09.480 --> 27:11.090
Mr. Yan's martial prowess

27:12.720 --> 27:14.240
will soon be mine to use.

27:27.550 --> 27:29.510
The "Voidheart Codex"
from the Central Plains

27:29.510 --> 27:32.040
actually contains such strange techniques.

28:00.070 --> 28:01.470
What's happening?

28:02.200 --> 28:03.960
Why can't I absorb

28:04.480 --> 28:05.550
all your power?

28:06.110 --> 28:07.550
The Voidheart Codex

28:08.240 --> 28:10.200
must have been obtained

28:10.400 --> 28:12.270
through despicable means, right?

28:12.270 --> 28:13.720
So you only know how to absorb,

28:13.720 --> 28:15.550
but not how to transform the energy.

28:15.550 --> 28:17.030
Want to absorb my power?

28:17.590 --> 28:19.510
Be careful not to burst yourself.

28:19.750 --> 28:21.680
That's not for you to worry.

28:22.640 --> 28:23.680
Sooner or later,

28:24.160 --> 28:25.550
I will take

28:25.960 --> 28:27.690
every single bit of your power.

28:28.830 --> 28:29.750
Seniors,

28:30.330 --> 28:32.920
please take good care of Mr. Yan.

28:57.960 --> 28:58.960
I heard that Chief

28:59.070 --> 29:01.200
will be entering the palace tomorrow.

29:02.070 --> 29:03.070
Today, Suifeng

29:03.720 --> 29:05.580
has come specially to see you off.

29:14.370 --> 29:16.610
I wish you a smooth journey.

29:17.310 --> 29:19.200
May the great cause planned for Daxi

29:19.200 --> 29:20.130
surely succeed.

29:23.920 --> 29:24.680
Suifeng,

29:27.340 --> 29:28.800
that's thoughtful of you.

30:02.140 --> 30:03.000
The second cup.

30:05.000 --> 30:07.610
I wish the Chief good health

30:07.670 --> 30:08.670
and longevity.

30:09.220 --> 30:10.910
In life or death, I, Suifeng,

30:11.830 --> 30:13.630
am willing to follow you, Chief.

30:13.790 --> 30:15.250
Before drinking this cup,

30:16.810 --> 30:18.200
I also have a toast

30:20.310 --> 30:21.070
for you.

30:23.920 --> 30:25.350
I hope when this is over,

30:26.650 --> 30:28.240
you can have your own life,

30:29.280 --> 30:30.810
not bound by the Power Gang,

30:30.970 --> 30:32.370
not bound to me,

30:34.000 --> 30:35.330
nor trapped by grudges.

30:37.640 --> 30:38.830
I will try my best.

30:49.700 --> 30:50.550
Why?

30:53.340 --> 30:54.340
It’s in this wine

30:55.680 --> 30:57.200
that your true dream lies.

31:02.920 --> 31:04.240
Have a good sleep.

31:11.510 --> 31:12.350
Chief.

31:13.480 --> 31:15.520
You can't enter the palace.

31:36.240 --> 31:37.270
How is he?

31:38.480 --> 31:39.680
He won't eat or drink,

31:39.900 --> 31:41.160
and doesn't say a word.

32:41.000 --> 32:42.310
Your mind is in chaos.

32:43.310 --> 32:45.350
It's only a matter of time
before you lose control of your powers.

32:45.350 --> 32:46.110
Shut up!

32:48.290 --> 32:49.620
At a time like this,

32:49.920 --> 32:51.720
you still dare to be so insolent?

32:52.750 --> 32:53.550
Go!

32:55.030 --> 32:56.290
Bring Xiao Xueyu here.

32:56.880 --> 32:57.470
Yes.

33:12.220 --> 33:12.870
Brother.

33:16.550 --> 33:17.270
Xueyu.

33:17.400 --> 33:19.230
Don't you have a lot to say to him?

33:20.550 --> 33:21.720
Try to persuade him.

33:26.430 --> 33:27.630
-Brother.
-I'm fine.

33:32.640 --> 33:33.550
In a few days,

33:34.310 --> 33:36.070
I'll find a way to get you out.

33:36.270 --> 33:36.920
No need.

33:38.310 --> 33:39.750
I don't want you to take risks for me.

33:39.750 --> 33:40.250
Brother.

33:40.250 --> 33:40.980
Listen to me.

33:43.240 --> 33:45.270
What I'm about to say is crucial.

33:46.270 --> 33:46.870
Come here.

33:50.970 --> 33:52.860
The Voidheart Codex.

34:55.770 --> 34:57.830
The 15 tiers of the Voidheart Codex are

34:57.830 --> 35:04.350
Heaven's Will, Earth's Shape, King's Rule,
Family's Love, Master's Teaching,

35:04.760 --> 35:10.150
Metal's Break, Wood's Resist, Water's
Flow, Fire's Spread, Earth's Cover,

35:10.630 --> 35:16.320
Sun's Glow, Moon's Reflection, Wind's
Path, Cloud's Shade, and Self's Void.

37:06.190 --> 37:07.650
The carriage has arrived.

37:19.730 --> 37:20.770
Shirong,

37:23.280 --> 37:24.470
it's time to go back.

37:40.720 --> 37:42.650
For your first time in the capital,

37:42.670 --> 37:44.870
you stayed in the palace for three days.

37:46.590 --> 37:48.850
The second time, you stayed for ten days.

37:50.620 --> 37:53.620
After that, your stays
have became longer and longer.

37:57.030 --> 37:58.070
This time,

38:00.230 --> 38:02.110
I don't know when you'll return.

38:06.320 --> 38:07.230
Things

38:09.320 --> 38:11.320
always get harder as they progress.

38:13.670 --> 38:14.670
Fortunately,

38:17.590 --> 38:19.030
it's almost over.

38:35.590 --> 38:36.320
Don't worry.

38:39.880 --> 38:41.410
As long as I've done my best,

38:42.840 --> 38:44.030
I have no regrets.

39:37.280 --> 39:39.700
♪ Stars and moon brush my face ♪

39:40.550 --> 39:43.330
♪ The journey of life
spreads out like a long scroll ♪

39:44.940 --> 39:48.110
♪ Past events linger
in the corner of my eye ♪

39:48.450 --> 39:52.850
♪ First meetings, then farewells ♪

39:53.700 --> 39:57.100
♪ How many layers in heaven and earth ♪

39:57.490 --> 40:00.850
♪ The mortal world is always the same ♪

40:01.790 --> 40:04.610
♪ Clouds and mountains
stretch west and east ♪

40:04.630 --> 40:09.330
♪ Chivalry dwells in the heart ♪

40:09.380 --> 40:11.380
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

40:11.410 --> 40:13.410
♪ A few words, laughter shared ♪

40:13.620 --> 40:16.360
♪ Swords and books,
the thrill of the blade ♪

40:16.940 --> 40:19.170
♪ Parting under thousands of miles
of wind, rain, and snow ♪

40:19.200 --> 40:24.550
♪ Embarking on the long road,
freely at ease ♪

40:25.390 --> 40:27.450
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

40:27.480 --> 40:29.480
♪ Several tides rise and fall ♪

40:29.610 --> 40:32.750
♪ Singing of the present while drunk ♪

40:33.000 --> 40:35.300
♪ Raising my head
to finish this cup of wine ♪

40:35.330 --> 40:39.430
♪ All grudges in the martial world
vanish in a stroke ♪

41:04.260 --> 41:04.780
Chief!

41:05.160 --> 41:05.690
Chief!

41:12.240 --> 41:12.760
Master!

41:13.400 --> 41:14.660
Master, you're awake.

41:15.500 --> 41:16.420
Has the Chief

41:17.190 --> 41:18.790
already entered the palace?

41:19.480 --> 41:20.140
Yes.

41:23.710 --> 41:24.400
No!

41:25.070 --> 41:26.130
I must get him back.

41:27.150 --> 41:28.360
Master!

41:28.840 --> 41:29.950
Even if we chase after him now,

41:29.950 --> 41:31.210
it's already too late.

41:39.800 --> 41:41.230
The Chief has maneuvered through life.

41:41.230 --> 41:43.920
His actions must've been
carefully considered.

41:43.920 --> 41:44.670
I hope...

41:46.230 --> 41:47.110
I hope the Chief

41:48.150 --> 41:51.010
can use his internal energy
to suppress the poison.

41:52.000 --> 41:54.550
As long as it doesn't damage
his heart meridian,

41:54.550 --> 41:56.680
there might still be a glimmer of hope.

41:57.920 --> 41:59.230
Master, please don't panic.

41:59.230 --> 42:00.420
There must be a way.

42:17.800 --> 42:19.110
Drink this herbal medicine
to calm your nerves.
